 "honest": [
  "the three-member skin is the NARROWEST reading in this family: its small leg is one name (sh510500), so its tilt is a broad-vs-mid read with no STAR or 512100 content -- it is published beside the four- and five-member rows, never as the identity",
  "the three skins differ in composition, not only in window: the small-leg member weights are stated in spec.small_leg_member_weight_pct so a reader can see what the delta is priced against",
  "deltas are printed only where both sides price the same months; where the wider skin covers fewer months the delta is null with the two denominators published",
  "the ladder and wide curves are the E24/E27 engine's own (module import), unchanged by the skin choice -- only the tilt regressor changes",
  "eras remain calendar partitions of one continuous monthly series and do not add up",
  "corporate-action guard as in E40 (drops >20% single-day member months)",
  "descriptive census only: no gate, no verdict, no prereg, no trial count"
